  "future_runtime_rules": [
    "A future runtime target must satisfy every required capability before it is documented as supported.",
    "Future runtime targets must consume the portable workload contract rather than adding provider logic to apps.",
    "Runtime-specific networking, identity, secrets, ingress, observability, rollout, rollback, and Terraform ownership stay at platform/delivery edges.",
    "Release evidence keeps the same provider-neutral core schema across runtimes, even when provider-native revision names differ."
  ]
